        "TileImage": "$($repository 252428ca-3f8e-4477-b2b9-58f18cff3e44).Image",
        "Description": "PRIMARY: Edelgard Winter\rSECONDARY: Lasse Danegod\r\rMs Winter is under inquiry for her involvement in a racial dispute with a man named Morris Baum. Winter enlisted Mr Danegod to gather his motorcycle gang compatriots to assault and murder Baum. Also complicit is undercover DEA Agent Micah Tremaine, who asymmetrically covered up the murder for Danegod, against Danegod&apos;s knowledge.\r\rThe family of Mr Baum would like Ms Winter and Mr Danegod&apos;s night cut short, as well as those complicit.",
